{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011YQGBbo6P9bUwZBNvUsheo","type":"tool_result","content":"928\t\n929\t\n930\t# The guard injected right after the mold's trap line. A mold that is itself\n931\t# a generated script carries it already: the parser recognises it as an owned\n932\t# region, so it is regenerated, never duplicated.\n933\t#\n934\t# It reads LITERALS the generator wrote, never a variable of the mold: the old\n935\t# form read $SENT/$SRC_PIN, and enumerating the assignment forms a mold could use\n936\t# before the trap failed twice in the rail (1.4.4 backlog, item 10). Hence also\n937\t# `env -u GREP_OPTIONS LC_ALL=C grep -F`, and a grep rc other than 0/1 is a refusal\n938\t# in the rehearsal too: a material it could not read is not a clean material.\n939\t_GUARD_PATH_RE = re.compile(r\"[A-Za-z0-9._/-]+\")\n940\t_GUARD_GREP_RE = re.compile(\n941\t    re.escape(_GUARD[2]).replace(re.escape(\"@SENT@\"), r\"[A-Za-z0-9._/-]+\")\n942\t    .replace(re.escape(\"@PIN@\"), r\"[A-Za-z0-9._/-]+\"))\n943\t# The exact guard of the packs generated before item 10 (they stay valid molds).\n944\t_LEGACY_GUARD = [\n945\t    f\"# [{GENERATOR}] a justificativa humana do pack fica em {TODO_MARK}:\",\n946\t    \"# o run real recusa assinar enquanto restar um; o ensaio só avisa.\",\n947\t    f\"if grep -n '{TODO_MARK}' \\\"$SENT\\\" \\\"$SRC_PIN\\\" 2>/dev/null; then\",\n948\t    f\"  [ \\\"$DRY\\\" = \\\"1\\\" ] || die \\\"{TODO_MARK} pendente nos materiais (linhas acima)\"\n949\t    \" — escreva a justificativa antes de assinar\\\"\",\n950\t    f\"  printf '   AVISO: {TODO_MARK} pendente — o run real vai recusar\\\\n'\",\n951\t    \"fi\",\n952\t]\n953\t_PENDING_FIELD_RE = re.compile(r\"(?:# )?\" + re.escape(TODO_MARK) + r\": \")\n954\t\n955\t\n956\tdef _guard_lines(ctx: Dict[str, Any]) -> List[str]:\n957\t    \"\"\"The guard with the two literal paths of THIS pack.\"\"\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e0cc364-80e9-432f-8fee-77